  "id": "personenvironment-interaction",
  "term": "person–environment interaction",
  "definition": "Person–environment interaction is the reciprocal relationship between people and their surrounding social environments, understood through complex models that can operate at different levels of social systems. In this context, it can also be considered at broader levels such as community or nation.",
